&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior People Operations Specialist, you will play a key role in delivering a seamless and positive employee experience throughout the entire employee lifecycle. You will own and continuously improve core People Operations processes, ensuring compliance, operational excellence and scalable service delivery from onboarding through offboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage end-to-end employee lifecycle administration from hire to exit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage employment contracts, amendments and employee data changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain employment documentation and templates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer vacation, sick leave and parental leave processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage employee inquiries and service requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive resolution of People Operations cases and tickets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support managers and employees with operational HR questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issue employment and reference letters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain employee guides and process documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardize employee lifecycle processes across locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Talent Attraction, HR Business Partners, managers and employees to deliver seamless People Operations support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process improvement opportunities and contribute to operational excellence initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain process documentation, work instructions and knowledge resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain efficient, compliant and employee-centric lifecycle processes while delivering excellent employee support and self-service solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
