&lt;li&gt;Govern Kyndryl and AV/vendor operations and approve change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage hardware standards, lifecycle and refresh.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with facilities and agencies on room and workplace technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise demand and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the service outcomes, standards and SLAs that Kyndryl and other partners deliver against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Govern Kyndryl performance, manage demand and escalations, and retain WPP accountability for the service.&lt;/li&gt;
